    "reference": "Authorization bead bu-eyx4dg for implementation bead bu-svqpzo.3 (PR #4622, permission, spend and pause gates fail closed when their state is unreadable). Reviewed before: main 7cfd3b301 plus this manifest PR's spec edits (the REQ-catalog-token-limits-001/-002 ID headers, the matching generalist-lead-focused-delegation delta line, and the base form of REQ-dashboard-permissions-002 'Runtime Permission Enforcement', which carries only the clauses true on main and kept by PR #4622: explicit grant allows, explicit revoke denies, effect paths refuse an unreadable store; no default-allow or fail-open clause); approved subject: PR #4622 head after its author edits (review bu-77vnvq), merged with that main plus the request file. Governing requirements REQ-catalog-token-limits-001 (Pre-Spawn Quota Check) and REQ-catalog-token-limits-002 (Truthful ledger pricing for the monthly ceiling) of openspec/specs/catalog-token-limits/spec.md, and REQ-dashboard-permissions-002 of openspec/specs/dashboard-permissions/spec.md, whose evolution from effect-only to every-caller fail-closed is the authorized change. This exact manifest requires its own independent review and protected-main publication before consumption; provenance text grants no runtime admission."
  },
